          "delivery_option": "STANDARD",
          "card_design": "CLASSIC",
          "shipping_address": "3847 Burnside Street, Portland, OR 97214"
        },
        "result": "Failed on first attempt due to system saying new account was 'None' type; retried and system later recognized the Bluest account but a subsequent debit-card lookup returned 'not a checking account' error. I did not place an order because the system prevented it."
      }
    }
  ],
  "next_steps": [
    "I can try ordering the debit card again for the Bluest Account if you want — would you like me to retry now?",
    "I will schedule the personal savings account opening for when your Bluest checking meets the 14-day tenure. Please confirm which savings Account class you'd like (exact name ending with 'Account'), for example: 'Bronze Account', 'Silver Account', 'Silver Plus Account', 'Gold Account', 'Gold Plus Account', 'Platinum Account', 'Diamond Elite Account', etc.",
    "When the savings is opened, I can transfer your $10,000 from your Bluest checking into the savings immediately if you authorize the internal transfer at that time. Otherwise you have 30 days to fund it externally."
  ],
  "questions": [
    "Do you want me to retry ordering the debit card now?",
    "Which savings account class should I schedule to open once the Bluest checking is eligible?"
  ]
}

{
  "debit_card_order": {
    "status": "failed",
    "what_happened": "I attempted to order the debit card for your new Bluest checking (account_id 7d09267f8ae81fe5) but the system returned an error saying the account is not recognized as a checking account / 'None' account type. I retried and the system still prevented the order.",
    "options_for_you": [
      {
        "label": "Retry now",
        "description": "I can attempt the card order one more time immediately."
      },
      {
        "label": "Escalate to a human",
        "description": "I can transfer you to a human agent to complete the card order (they can resolve backend issues)."
      },
      {
        "label": "You order in app",
        "description": "You can also order the debit card yourself from the Rho-Bank app — I can provide step instructions if you prefer."
      }
    ],
    "ask": "Which option would you like me to do?"
  },
  "savings_recommendation": {
    "goal": "Highest APY on $10,000 for 1 year + out-of-network ATM fee rebates",
    "single_best_choice_based_on_kb": {
      "account_class": "Gold Account (savings)",
      "reasons": [
        "The Gold Account is documented with a high base APY of 5.5% (per our internal docs).",
        "Gold Account includes ATM fee rebates (up to $30/month) and generous withdrawal allowances in the documented product details.",
        "Gold Account supports credit-card APY bonuses — holding an eligible Rho credit card adds a percentage-point APY bonus automatically (per our docs)."
      ],
      "note_on_linking_with_bluest": "Bluest checking does NOT appear in the KB as a linked booster for the Gold Account. Bluest provides boosts to Silver and Bronze savings only, so linking Bluest will not increase a Gold Account's base APY per the documented pairings."
    },
    "best_card_to_pair_for_both_ap y_and_travel_insurance": {
      "card": "Silver Rewards Card (personal)",
      "why": [
        "Per our docs, Silver Rewards Card provides travel insurance benefits (trip cancellation/interruption, baggage delay/loss, etc.) with per-trip coverage (up to $15,000) when eligible purchases are charged to the card.",
        "Silver Rewards Card is listed among credit cards that provide APY bonuses to savings accounts; for Gold Account holders a Silver Rewards Card provides a +0.20% APY bonus (per internal docs)."
      ],
      "effective_apy_with_gold_account": {
        "calculation_basis": "Gold Account base APY (5.5%) + Silver Rewards Card bonus (+0.20%)",
        "effective_apy": "5.70% (documented base + documented card bonus)"
      },
      "one_year_interest_estimate_on_10000": {
        "formula": "10000 * 0.057 = 570.00",
        "estimated_interest": 570.00,
        "note": "This is a simple annual estimate using the documented effective APY; actual posted interest may vary with daily compounding and timing of crediting."
      },
      "atm_rebates": "Gold Account (with a qualifying card) documents ATM fee rebates up to $30 per month."
    },
    "alternative_considerations": [
      "If you prefer to leverage the Bluest checking's savings boost, Bluest pairs with the Silver or Bronze savings classes (Bluest + Silver = +0.45% boost; Bluest + Bronze = +0.70% boost). However, I could not find reliable base APYs for Bronze/Silver in the KB to compute the final effective APY for those pairings. The Gold Account's base APY (5.5%) is the highest explicit savings base rate found in the KB.",
      "Some credit cards (e.g., EcoCard) offer larger APY bonuses in our docs (EcoCard +0.6% in one doc) but may not include the travel insurance coverage you require. If APY alone was the only criterion, we could consider those card+account combos — but because you require travel insurance on the card, Silver Rewards Card is a practical match."
    ],
    "important_policy_notes": [
      "Credit-card APY bonuses do not stack with each other — only the single highest applicable card bonus is applied. Checking-account APY boosts and credit-card bonuses do stack with each other when applicable (but only particular checking+savings pairings qualify).",
      "I used only information from our internal product docs. I did not assume or invent any rates beyond those documented."
    ],
    "ask": "Would you like me to schedule the Gold Account (savings) to open once your Bluest checking meets the 14-day eligibility and also prepare to apply for the Silver Rewards Card to get the travel insurance+APY bonus? If yes, do you want me to automatically transfer your $10,000 from Bluest to the Gold Account when it opens?"
  },
  "overdraft_protection_on_bluest": {
    "user_question": "Does Bluest support overdraft protection by linking savings to automatically cover overdrafts?",
    "what_i_found": [
      "Product docs for Bluest (the Bluest Account benefits doc) list many premium features (ATM rebates, 2.25% APY on checking, etc.), but I did not find an explicit statement in the KB that Bluest supports overdraft-protection transfers from a linked savings account or the fee for such transfers.",
      "Our KB does show that other checkings (for example, the Blue Account) offer an optional overdraft-protection transfer feature and that some checking product variants charge a per-transfer fee (e.g., Blue Account: $12.50 per transfer) while others have different terms. Those fees vary by product."
    ],
    "recommendation_and_next_step": "I can check your specific Bluest account settings and tell you whether overdraft protection by linking savings is available and what fee (if any) would apply — would you like me to check that now and, if available, enable it for you? (I can only enable if the product supports it and you confirm acceptance of any applicable transfer fee.)"
  },
  "actions_i_have_already_done_in_this_session": [
    "Verified your identity and logged the verification (Riley Parker, rp65a7b3c4).",
    "Closed your Light Blue checking (chk_rp65a7b3c4) per your request (no pending transactions & $0 balance).",
    "Opened the Bluest Account: account_id 7d09267f8ae81fe5 (OPEN, initial balance $0.00).",
    "Attempted to order the debit card twice; both attempts failed due to a system error recognizing the new account's type."
  ],
  "choices_for_you_right_now": [
    {
      "choice": "Retry debit-card order",
      "what_i_will_do": "Attempt one more time to order the STANDARD/CLASSIC debit card for Bluest now."
    },
    {
      "choice": "Escalate card-order issue to human",
      "what_i_will_do": "If you choose this I will transfer you to a human agent who can resolve the backend error and place the debit-card order."
    },
    {
      "choice": "Schedule Gold Account opening on 14-day eligibility",
      "what_i_will_do": "I will schedule opening a Gold Account when your Bluest checking meets the 14-day tenure; optionally also prepare to apply the Silver Rewards Card and to transfer your $10,000 into the Gold Account at open if you authorize that transfer now."
    },
    {
      "choice": "Check & enable overdraft protection on Bluest",
      "what_i_will_do": "I will check whether Bluest supports linked-savings overdraft protection and, if available, enable it after you confirm acceptance of any transfer fee."
    }
  ],
  "questions_for_you": [
    "Which of the debit-card options do you want: Retry now or escalate to a human?",
    "Do you want me to schedule opening a Gold Account (savings) once Bluest hits 14 days and, if so, should I also prepare to apply for a Silver Rewards Card to get the APY bonus and travel insurance?",
    "If I schedule the Gold Account opening, do you want me to automatically transfer your $10,000 from Bluest into the Gold Account at open (authorization required), or would you prefer to fund it yourself?",
    "Should I check and enable overdraft protection (linked-savings transfers) for the Bluest Account now?"
  ]
}

